== Active Skills ==

This section is for class-specific active abilities that should appear in build guides alongside spells. Build guides transclude the labeled sections named <code>ActiveSkills:Class Name</code>. Empty class placeholders are visible here for editors, but they are intentionally outside the labeled sections so they do not appear in build guides.

Rows should be limited to actively triggered abilities, such as combat buttons, emergency abilities, class utility buttons, and racial activated abilities. Passive skills, weapon skills, trade skills, and casting schools should remain in the general [[#Passive_Skills|Passive Skills]] table above unless they also have an actively triggered use.

